Homepage: https://github.com/faircomp/linuxmuster-fileserver-verwaltung
Description: Dedicated administration fileserver for linuxmuster.net 7.3
 Joins a dedicated Ubuntu 24.04 server to the Samba Active Directory of a
 linuxmuster.net 7.3 installation and provides a single SMB share
 ("Verwaltung") whose permissions are managed entirely from Windows.
 .
 Unlike the upstream linuxmuster-fileserver package, this server hosts no
 sophomorix-managed data: no home directories, no class or project shares.
 The share is therefore never touched by sophomorix-repair, and all access
 control lives in NT ACLs stored in extended attributes.
 .
 The package is derived from linuxmuster-fileserver by Netzint GmbH.
